langis-gui is an unofficial client. It is not made by, affiliated with, or
endorsed by Signal Messenger, LLC.

It is built on langis (../langis), a fork of Vernam by Ken Powers
(https://github.com/knpwrs/vernam, AGPL-3.0). src/notices.rs is ported
from Vernam's views/notices.rs.

Its look follows Signal Desktop (https://github.com/signalapp/Signal-Desktop,
Copyright Signal Messenger, LLC, AGPL-3.0-only):
- assets/icons/*.svg are Signal Desktop's images/icons/v3 icons, recolored
  white so they can be tinted.
- Colors, sizes and text come from its stylesheets and ts/axo design tokens.
- assets/fonts/SignalSymbols-Regular.ttf is Signal Desktop's
  fonts/signal-symbols/SignalSymbolsVariable.woff2, converted to TrueType
  and fixed at weight 400; src/symbols.rs is generated from its
  ts/axo/_internal/AxoSymbolDefs.generated.std.ts.
- src/menu.rs follows its AxoDropdownMenu and AxoBaseMenu.

assets/fonts/Inter-*.ttf: Inter 3.19 by Rasmus Andersson, SIL Open Font
License 1.1 (https://github.com/rsms/inter), converted from the WOFF2 files
Signal Desktop ships.
